#name:Aiden
<i>ugghhhhhhh…. What the hell is wrong with me? </i>
Oh good evening madam.. I was just doing some.. Soul searching

#name:Ingrid
Okay, and did you find anything?

#name:Aiden
I- <i>*Sigh*</i>
My entire life I’ve been told that the lower classes were worse. Simply inferior to us nobles and that it was our job as the Miraults to give even a modicum of luxury to them so they wouldn’t be as “filthy”. 

#name:Ingrid
And do you believe that?

#name:Aiden
I used to eat it up, we had more money after all. What did it matter what they thought? <i>*Chuckle*</i>... But look at me now. I have one regular here and she’s one of the people I was always told to hate. And not only that, she's the only person here trying to better this damn place. What a joke..

#name:Ingrid
Huh? where did you-

#name:Aiden
There’s been a small rumor going around. You’re not going down there for just wealth are you?

#name:Ingrid
I-

#name:Aiden
You don't need to tell me. I don't exactly deserve it. I just wanted to say sorry, for uh- being an asshole.

#name:Ingrid 
Heh.. Well from the look of things your family sounds far worse. Apology accepted. 

#name:Aiden
Thanks, Ingrid. 

//Aiden becomes befriended//

